178
00:10:01,720 --> 00:10:03,800
Feixin, you're in great shape.

179
00:10:04,000 --> 00:10:05,260
Please take your seat.

180
00:10:06,920 --> 00:10:07,520
How was it?

181
00:10:07,720 --> 00:10:08,120
Great.

182
00:10:08,120 --> 00:10:10,850
I hope everyone can be in great shape like Feixin.

183
00:10:11,920 --> 00:10:12,400
Jinxi,

184
00:10:14,200 --> 00:10:15,000
