213
00:11:58,400 --> 00:11:59,000
Not bad.

214
00:12:02,040 --> 00:12:06,520
Two, two, three. Can you keep up?

215
00:12:07,200 --> 00:12:08,160
Yes, I can.

216
00:12:08,720 --> 00:12:09,480
Open.

217
00:12:09,720 --> 00:12:10,080
Down.

218
00:12:11,240 --> 00:12:12,680
Three, four.

219
00:12:14,120 --> 00:12:17,000
Five, six, down, seven, eight.

220
00:12:17,440 --> 00:12:20,320
Two, two, up, turn.

221
00:12:29,080 --> 00:12:29,480
Good.

222
00:12:30,520 --> 00:12:31,380
