236
00:13:25,000 --> 00:13:25,330
Okay.

237
00:13:26,320 --> 00:13:26,960
Jin Xi.

238
00:13:27,480 --> 00:13:30,280
Trust exercises build chemistry between actors.

239
00:13:30,840 --> 00:13:31,720
