242
00:13:48,840 --> 00:13:51,000
I'm fine. Just a little nervous.

243
00:13:51,000 --> 00:13:52,660
Good thing we have chemistry.

244
00:13:53,400 --> 00:13:55,400
Good thing we have great chemistry.

245
00:13:58,400 --> 00:13:58,840
Bye.

246
00:13:58,840 --> 00:14:00,880
