263
00:14:19,680 --> 00:14:20,440
Team building?

264
00:14:20,440 --> 00:14:21,120
Sure.

265
00:14:21,120 --> 00:14:21,680
Team building?

266
00:14:21,680 --> 00:14:22,280
No.

267
00:14:22,280 --> 00:14:22,880
I mean...

268
00:14:22,880 --> 00:14:23,720
Let's all go together.

269
00:14:23,720 --> 00:14:24,400
Team building tomorrow.

270
00:14:24,400 --> 00:14:24,840
Sure.

271
00:14:29,280 --> 00:14:29,960
