293
00:15:07,880 --> 00:15:09,680
Right, we don't have each other's WeChat yet.

294
00:15:09,680 --> 00:15:10,720
Let's add each other on WeChat.

295
00:15:10,720 --> 00:15:12,080
I'll add you to the group chat later.

296
00:15:12,080 --> 00:15:12,440
Okay.

297
00:15:13,640 --> 00:15:14,680
I can just add you.

298
00:15:16,000 --> 00:15:16,800
