299
00:15:16,960 --> 00:15:17,560
Nothing.

300
00:15:19,200 --> 00:15:19,800
All right.

301
00:15:19,960 --> 00:15:20,640
Added you.

302
00:15:20,720 --> 00:15:21,680
We should get going.

303
00:15:21,680 --> 00:15:22,680
All right, bye.

304
00:15:22,680 --> 00:15:24,880
Bye.

305
00:15:25,000 --> 00:15:26,000
See you tomorrow.

306
00:15:28,200 --> 00:15:29,840
What are you fooling around for?

307
00:15:29,840 --> 00:15:31,700
What do you mean, fooling around?

308
00:15:31,880 --> 00:15:33,280
Do you think I can't tell?

309
00:15:33,520 --> 00:15:36,580
Are you trying to get close to Jinxi to use her for clout?

310
00:15:37,200 --> 00:15:39,720
I just want to act like a couple to get some clout.

311
00:15:39,720 --> 00:15:40,240
You have no idea.

312
00:15:40,240 --> 00:15:42,100
