313
00:15:44,040 --> 00:15:45,720
Fine, but know your limits.

314
00:15:46,120 --> 00:15:48,520
Make sure it doesn't affect the rehearsal.

315
00:16:14,360 --> 00:16:14,720
Baby,

316
00:16:15,360 --> 00:16:16,360
