318
00:16:17,520 --> 00:16:18,240
Look, it's still this one.

319
00:16:18,240 --> 00:16:20,040
I was scared to death by that female ghost.

320
00:16:20,040 --> 00:16:21,900
Good thing I had you to protect me.

321
00:16:24,080 --> 00:16:26,280
Why are you dressed like a special forces soldier for an escape room?

322
00:16:26,280 --> 00:16:27,340
Bring more things.

323
00:16:27,480 --> 00:16:28,640
Better safe than sorry.

324
00:16:28,640 --> 00:16:30,100
