327
00:16:47,520 --> 00:16:49,800
Jinxi, you look so handsome today.

328
00:16:52,280 --> 00:16:53,280
You guys came too.

329
00:16:53,800 --> 00:16:54,840
Of course we came.

330
00:16:56,520 --> 00:16:58,450
I didn't know you guys were coming.

331
00:16:58,480 --> 00:17:00,560
I only bought five tickets.

332
00:17:01,440 --> 00:17:02,440
What should we do?

333
