Only five of us can go in.

334
00:17:05,079 --> 00:17:05,880
It's fine.

335
00:17:05,880 --> 00:17:07,920
I guess Eason and Sister Hu wouldn't like it anyway.

336
00:17:07,920 --> 00:17:08,849
We can just go in.

337
00:17:10,839 --> 00:17:12,480
How's the privacy here?

338
00:17:12,480 --> 00:17:13,680
Don't worry, it's very private.

339
00:17:13,680 --> 00:17:14,440
A friend of mine runs it.

340
00:17:14,440 --> 00:17:15,440
I've already talked to them.

341
00:17:15,440 --> 00:17:16,520
Hurry up.

342
00:17:17,240 --> 00:17:17,770
Let's go.

343
00:17:18,119 --> 00:17:18,599
Let's go.

344
00:17:18,599 --> 00:17:19,400
This place is really fun.

345
00:17:19,400 --> 00:17:21,329
Every NPC inside is professional.

346
00:17:21,800 --> 00:17:22,319
I can't wait.

347
00:17:22,319 --> 00:17:23,920
Baby, you have to protect me.

348
00:17:24,079 --> 00:17:24,740
I'm scared.

349
00:17:29,840 --> 00:17:30,280
David.

350
00:17:31,400 --> 00:17:33,800
If you see any physical contact

351
00:17:33,920 --> 00:17:37,240
like holding hands or leaning against Jinxi's chest later,

352
00:17:37,240 --> 00:17:38,720
