353
00:17:38,720 --> 00:17:40,880
Sure, you are a good customer, so no problem.

354
00:17:40,880 --> 00:17:41,480
Thank you.

355
00:17:41,960 --> 00:17:42,490
Go ahead.

356
00:17:47,120 --> 00:17:47,580
Come in.

357
00:17:50,280 --> 00:17:51,400
Don't scare me.

358
00:18:04,640 --> 00:18:05,520
AD

359
00:18:07,720 --> 00:18:08,840
3025.

360
00:18:09,880 --> 00:18:12,000
Earth was invaded by zombies.

361
00:18:12,480 --> 00:18:13,440
It's the end of the world

362
00:18:13,440 --> 00:18:14,900
and people are suffering.

363
00:18:17,680 --> 00:18:18,680
I was infected,

364
00:18:19,440 --> 00:18:22,120
and although I used antivenom,

365
00:18:22,320 --> 00:18:23,180
there are still

366
00:18:24,880 --> 00:18:25,920
