369
00:18:35,520 --> 00:18:37,120
You are the last hope of humanity.

370
00:18:37,120 --> 00:18:38,380
Attention, everyone.

371
00:18:38,520 --> 00:18:41,450
My patience is shorter than a zombie's fingernails.

372
00:18:41,480 --> 00:18:43,080
Now your task is

373
00:18:43,080 --> 00:18:45,280
to find the serum bank with the sun logo.

374
00:18:45,680 --> 00:18:47,040
This is your final task.

375
00:18:47,440 --> 00:18:48,120
I wish you

376
00:18:49,720 --> 00:18:50,180
safety.

377
00:18:52,760 --> 00:18:53,360
Stay safe.

378
00:18:55,480 --> 00:18:58,280
All right, the game officially begins now.

379
00:18:58,280 --> 00:18:59,800
Let's team up in pairs.

380
00:19:00,680 --> 00:19:03,200
But there are only five of us now. What should we do?

381
00:19:03,200 --> 00:19:03,530
Baby,

382
00:19:04,000 --> 00:19:05,860
I'll definitely team up with you.

383
00:19:06,920 --> 00:19:09,180
It's fine. I happen to like acting alone.

384
00:19:11,600 --> 00:19:12,480
Jinxi, that's great!

385
00:19:12,480 --> 00:19:13,520
We'll be a team.

386
00:19:20,080 --> 00:19:20,880
Excuse me.

387
00:19:20,880 --> 00:19:23,480
Are you interested in making some extra money?

388
00:19:30,640 --> 00:19:32,640
Jinxi, are you scared?

389
00:19:32,640 --> 00:19:33,720
A little.

390
00:19:33,720 --> 00:19:36,200
A little? I'm quite scared.

391
00:19:42,000 --> 00:19:43,520
The NPC just said

392
00:19:43,680 --> 00:19:45,360
