393
00:19:49,000 --> 00:19:50,400
But I'm a bit scared.

394
00:19:53,520 --> 00:19:55,080
Let's do this together.

395
00:19:55,600 --> 00:19:56,920
Hold my hand.

396
00:20:10,320 --> 00:20:11,000
Jinxi.

397
00:20:11,360 --> 00:20:11,640
Jinxi,

398
00:20:11,640 --> 00:20:12,770
where are you going?

399
00:20:13,640 --> 00:20:15,170
Where are you chasing me to?

400
00:20:15,480 --> 00:20:16,280
Sister Hu.

401
00:20:17,880 --> 00:20:18,520
No way.

402
00:20:18,720 --> 00:20:20,400
How could you still recognize me like this?

403
00:20:20,400 --> 00:20:22,000
How could I not recognize you?

404
00:20:22,000 --> 00:20:22,880
I'm telling you.

405
00:20:22,880 --> 00:20:25,280
Stay away from that Bai... whatever her name is.

406
00:20:25,280 --> 00:20:26,040
Stay far away from her.

407
00:20:26,040 --> 00:20:27,480
She's definitely up to no good.

408
00:20:27,480 --> 00:20:28,800
I think she's fine.

409
00:20:28,800 --> 00:20:30,280
Trust me on this.

410
00:20:30,280 --> 00:20:31,400
My eyes are like a ruler.

411
00:20:31,400 --> 00:20:32,720
I'm never wrong about people.

412
00:20:32,720 --> 00:20:33,880
Go on and have fun.

413
00:20:33,880 --> 00:20:34,480
I'll go keep an eye on her.

414
00:20:34,480 --> 00:20:34,920
Go.

415
00:20:34,920 --> 00:20:35,360
Go.

416
00:20:37,720 --> 00:20:38,560
Watch me.

417
00:21:06,200 --> 00:21:08,730
Do you really think you can scare me like this?

418
00:21:10,120 --> 00:21:11,120
In the whole room,

419
00:21:12,080 --> 00:21:13,740
this is the only place to hide.

420
00:21:14,200 --> 00:21:15,930
Of course I'd know you're here.

421
00:21:16,120 --> 00:21:18,120
Come on, do your performance again.

422
00:21:21,280 --> 00:21:23,940
Have you seen zombies in those doomsday movies?

423
00:21:24,400 --> 00:21:26,600
A zombie's muscles should be stiff,

424
00:21:27,120 --> 00:21:28,720
but your limbs are too loose.

425
00:21:29,440 --> 00:21:30,600
What you need to do now

426
00:21:30,600 --> 00:21:32,280
is to engage all your muscles.

427
00:21:32,600 --> 00:21:33,860
Like me. Come on, do it.

428
00:21:34,320 --> 00:21:36,640
Feel your muscles engaging,

429
00:21:36,640 --> 00:21:37,400
getting stiff.

430
00:21:37,400 --> 00:21:38,530
You are a zombie now.

431
00:21:38,600 --> 00:21:38,930
Do it.

432
00:21:41,320 --> 00:21:42,850
That's better. Do it again.

433
00:21:44,000 --> 00:21:45,600
Not hard enough. Keep going.

434
00:21:46,640 --> 00:21:48,000
And your vocal placement

435
00:21:48,000 --> 00:21:49,600
