436
00:21:49,760 --> 00:21:50,220
Inhale.

437
00:21:51,880 --> 00:21:53,520
No. Relax your chest.

438
00:21:53,920 --> 00:21:54,880
Inhale all the way down,

439
00:21:54,880 --> 00:21:56,440
