440
00:21:56,440 --> 00:21:57,370
Feel my fingers.

441
00:21:57,520 --> 00:21:58,120
Vocalize.

442
00:21:59,360 --> 00:22:00,000
Harder.

443
00:22:00,880 --> 00:22:01,920
Feel my fingers.

444
00:22:01,920 --> 00:22:02,880
Use your chest.

445
00:22:03,200 --> 00:22:06,040
Harder. Keep going. Come on.

446
00:22:14,480 --> 00:22:16,800
Jin Xi, I finally found you.

447
00:22:16,800 --> 00:22:19,880
I'm so scared. A ghost keeps chasing me.

448
00:22:28,080 --> 00:22:30,120
To be honest,

449
00:22:30,120 --> 00:22:32,320
I also have a dream of becoming an actor.

450
00:22:32,520 --> 00:22:34,040
It's been years since I graduated,

451
00:22:34,040 --> 00:22:36,080
