452
00:22:36,480 --> 00:22:38,280
Actually, studying acting

453
00:22:38,280 --> 00:22:40,140
makes it really hard to find a job.

454
00:22:40,320 --> 00:22:41,320
As for joining a crew,

455
00:22:41,320 --> 00:22:43,880
there are so many of them that I don't know which one to go to.

456
00:22:43,880 --> 00:22:45,000
If I sign with an agency,

457
00:22:45,000 --> 00:22:46,600
I'm afraid of getting scammed.

458
00:22:46,600 --> 00:22:49,640
You see, I've studied dance and acting since I was a kid.

459
00:22:49,640 --> 00:22:51,900
I don't know what career to switch to now.

460
00:22:53,480 --> 00:22:54,280
I understand.

461
00:23:05,040 --> 00:23:05,920
I'm exhausted.

462
00:23:06,600 --> 00:23:09,200
Jinxi, I finally found you.

463
00:23:09,200 --> 00:23:10,000
We meet again.

464
00:23:12,720 --> 00:23:13,840
Why is it you again?

465
00:23:16,080 --> 00:23:18,040
Start running, baby.

466
00:23:21,080 --> 00:23:23,000
I really don't know what you're mad about.

467
00:23:23,000 --> 00:23:24,520
We agreed to adventure and run together.

468
00:23:24,520 --> 00:23:25,400
Why did you run ahead?

469
00:23:25,400 --> 00:23:26,400
I'm a girl.

470
00:23:26,400 --> 00:23:28,400
Are you expecting me to protect you?

471
00:23:28,840 --> 00:23:29,480
Get back.

472
00:23:29,480 --> 00:23:30,200
We're in the middle of an argument.

473
00:23:30,200 --> 00:23:31,530
Can't you read the room?

474
00:23:31,600 --> 00:23:32,920
Of course I can protect you.

475
00:23:32,920 --> 00:23:34,520
But only if we stay together.

476
00:23:34,520 --> 00:23:36,720
I don't want to listen, I don't, I don't!

477
00:23:36,720 --> 00:23:39,050
If you don't listen, I'll be mad, mad, mad!

478
00:23:47,880 --> 00:23:48,440
Jin Xi.

479
00:23:50,440 --> 00:23:52,500
Aren't you in a group with Bai Feixin?

480
00:23:53,320 --> 00:23:54,800
Due to some human factors,

481
00:23:54,800 --> 00:23:55,800
