482
00:23:58,120 --> 00:23:59,640
I found the virus serum.

483
00:23:59,640 --> 00:24:01,040
There should be a way out.

484
00:24:06,840 --> 00:24:07,320
Doctor.

485
00:24:09,360 --> 00:24:15,400
I'm just an old woman

486
00:24:15,400 --> 00:24:19,680
