489
00:24:29,920 --> 00:24:31,480
Give it to me.

490
00:24:32,440 --> 00:24:37,200
I can show you a way out.

491
00:24:39,280 --> 00:24:40,740
Can you really take us out?

492
00:24:44,280 --> 00:24:45,920
She's just an old lady.

493
00:24:45,920 --> 00:24:46,800
Give it to her.

494
00:24:52,320 --> 00:24:54,480
This road,

495
00:24:54,480 --> 00:24:57,440
I've walked it for over seventy years.

496
00:24:58,600 --> 00:25:02,400
Come, I'll show you the way.

497
00:25:02,400 --> 00:25:04,520
Come in.

498
00:25:05,840 --> 00:25:07,200
Find a way.

499
00:25:09,560 --> 00:25:11,040
I'm sorry.

500
00:25:11,040 --> 00:25:12,120
Every man for himself,

501
00:25:12,120 --> 00:25:13,520
