502
00:25:13,520 --> 00:25:15,680
Just starve to death in there.

503
00:25:17,480 --> 00:25:18,840
I wouldn't even laugh if you screamed.

504
00:25:18,840 --> 00:25:19,680
I'm off work.

505
00:25:22,640 --> 00:25:25,040
I told you we shouldn't have given it to her.

506
00:25:27,400 --> 00:25:28,800
I'm sorry, it's my fault.

507
00:25:36,080 --> 00:25:38,140
How are we supposed to get out of here?

508
00:26:01,280 --> 00:26:02,320
Don't you think

509
00:26:03,440 --> 00:26:05,000
it's just like when we were in...

510
00:26:05,000 --> 00:26:05,520
Shut up.

511
00:26:30,840 --> 00:26:33,640
Didn't you say you weren't afraid of these things?

512
00:26:35,000 --> 00:26:36,400
I'm not afraid of ghosts,

513
00:26:37,440 --> 00:26:40,170
but I really hate dark and small places like this.

514
00:26:46,720 --> 00:26:47,320
It's okay.

515
00:26:47,760 --> 00:26:48,800
They can't possibly

516
00:26:48,800 --> 00:26:50,130
lock us up here forever.

517
00:27:04,440 --> 00:27:06,440
This place seems to be a hidden door.

518
00:27:12,200 --> 00:27:13,040
Go this way.
